    group speakers members ["tom","tom_name","masha","masha_name"] hidden true

    card title "Coffee with milk"

A: How do you ask for coffee with milk in Russian, or say who you're with?
    draw i_coffee i_milk parallel true

B: Ко́фе с молоко́м.
    draw g_cm

A: С means with: one letter, no vowel, so it's said together with the next word.
    highlight g_cm_w_2 color #c9871a effect underline

A: And listen to the milk: молоко́…
    draw t_from

A: …has become молоко́м. After с, the word changes its end.
    draw t_arrow t_to

A: Grammar books call it the instrumental; we'll call it the with-ending.
    draw t_name

    erase i_coffee i_milk g_cm t_from t_arrow t_to t_name

B: Most words take one of two: ом after a consonant or о, and ой for words in а.
    draw h_left b_div h_right

B: First, a new word: са́хар, sugar.
    draw r_sugar_b r_sugar r_sugar_g

A: Tea with sugar is чай с са́харом.
    draw s_tea

A: The two с sounds run together into one long s.
    highlight s_tea color #c9871a effect underline part "с са́харом"

A: Са́хар ends in a consonant, so it simply adds ом.
    highlight r_sugar color #c9871a part ом$

    erase s_tea

A: Сыр does the same: хлеб с сы́ром, bread with cheese.
    draw r_cheese_b r_cheese r_cheese_g s_bread

    erase s_bread

B: Молоко́ already ends in о, so it only adds м, and ends in ом too.
    draw r_milk_b r_milk r_milk_g

    quiz "Now guess: with my brother, с … ? Pick one." store chk voice b
        right: Брат ends in a consonant, so it adds ом, just like са́хар.
        wrong: Брат ends in a consonant, like са́хар and сыр.
        * с бра́та
        + с бра́том
        * с бра́ту

A: People take it too: я иду́ в кино́ с бра́том, I'm going to the cinema with my brother.
    draw r_bro_b r_bro r_bro_g s_bro

B: There's no my in it: with family, Russian mostly leaves it out.
    highlight s_bro color #c9871a effect underline part "с бра́том"

    erase s_bro

A: Words in а work differently: they swap the а for ой. Ма́ма, с ма́мой.
    draw r_mum_b r_mum r_mum_g

B: Я живу́ в Москве́ с сестро́й: I live in Moscow with my sister.
    draw r_sis_b r_sis r_sis_g s_sis

    erase s_sis

A: And from the market, ры́ба: суп с ры́бой, soup with fish.
    draw r_fish_b r_fish r_fish_g s_fish

    erase s_fish

A: Most words, not all. Чай ends in й…
    draw x_rule x_tea

A: …so it takes ем: чай, с ча́ем.
    draw x_tea_n

B: And my own name bends the а rule a little…
    draw x_masha

B: …after ш, it's ей: с Ма́шей.
    draw x_masha_n

A: So after с, most words that end in a consonant or о take ом…
    highlight r_sugar r_cheese r_milk r_bro color #c9871a part ом$

B: …and a word in а trades its а for ой.
    highlight r_mum r_sis r_fish color #c9871a part ой$

    hide h_left h_right b_div r_sugar_b r_sugar r_sugar_g r_cheese_b r_cheese r_cheese_g r_milk_b r_milk r_milk_g r_bro_b r_bro r_bro_g r_mum_b r_mum r_mum_g r_sis_b r_sis r_sis_g r_fish_b r_fish r_fish_g x_rule x_tea x_tea_n x_masha x_masha_n

B: Back at the café: I'm the waitress again, and Tom orders.
    draw tom tom_name masha masha_name parallel true

    dialogue talk speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"b","text":"Здра́вствуйте! Что вы хоти́те?","gloss":"Hello! What would you like?"},{"by":"a","text":"Ко́фе с молоко́м, пожа́луйста.","gloss":"Coffee with milk, please."},{"by":"b","text":"С са́харом?","gloss":"With sugar?"},{"by":"a","text":"Нет, спаси́бо. И хлеб с сы́ром.","gloss":"No, thanks. And bread with cheese."},{"by":"b","text":"Пожа́луйста!","gloss":"Here you are!"}] size 1.3

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

A: Ко́фе never changes, but молоко́ does: ко́фе с молоко́м.
    highlight talk_2_words color #c9871a effect underline part "с молоко́м"

B: With a rising voice, С са́харом? is already a whole question: no extra word needed.
    highlight talk_3_words color #c9871a effect underline part "С са́харом?"

    erase talk

    hide speakers

    icon t1_pic size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["milk"] icon_look picture of "glass of milk"

    quiz "Tea with milk: Чай с … Which word fills the gap?" above t1_pic store q1 reveal.text "Чай с молоко́м." reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: After с, молоко́ adds м.
        wrong: Молока́ is the of-ending, as in нет молока́; with needs its own.
        * молоко́
        * молока́
        + молоко́м

    pause 1.2

    erase t1_pic q1_stamp

    icon t2_pic size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman

    quiz "Tom is going to the cinema with his mum: Я иду́ в кино́ с … Which word fills the gap?" above t2_pic store q2 reveal.text "Я иду́ в кино́ с ма́мой." reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Ма́ма ends in а, so the а turns into ой.
        wrong: Ма́му is the object ending, as in я ви́жу ма́му; with takes another.
        + ма́мой
        * ма́му
        * ма́мом

    pause 1.2

    erase t2_pic q2_stamp

    icon t3_pic size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["hot beverage"] icon_look picture of "teacup without handle"

    ask "Ask for tea with sugar: Чай с … Type the missing word." above t3_pic answer ["сахаром","с сахаром"] store q3 default са́харом reveal.text "Чай с са́харом." reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Са́хар ends in a consonant, so it adds ом: с са́харом.
        wrong: Start from са́хар, and add the with-ending for a consonant.

    pause 1.2

    erase t3_pic q3_stamp

    icon t4_pic size 130 set twemoji x 430 y 560 or ["cheese"] icon_look picture of "cheese wedge"
    icon t4_pic2 size 130 set twemoji x 570 y 560 or ["baguette bread"] icon_look picture of bread

    quiz "Bread with cheese. Pick one." store q4 reveal.text "Хлеб с сы́ром." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 330 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Сыр ends in a consonant, so it adds ом.
        wrong: Сыр can't stay plain after с, and ой is for words in а.
        * Хлеб с сыр.
        * Хлеб с сы́рой.
        + Хлеб с сы́ром.

    pause 1.2

    erase t4_pic t4_pic2 q4_stamp

    icon t5_pic size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["person"] icon_look picture of man

    quiz "And now with his dad: Я иду́ в кино́ с … Which word fills the gap?" above t5_pic store q5 reveal.text "Я иду́ в кино́ с па́пой." reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Па́па is a he, but he ends in а, and а turns into ой.
        wrong: Look at the last letter, not at he or she.
        * па́пом
        + па́пой
        * па́па

    pause 1.2

    erase t5_pic q5_stamp

    show h_left h_right b_div r_sugar r_sugar_g r_cheese r_cheese_g r_milk r_milk_g r_bro r_bro_g r_mum r_mum_g r_sis r_sis_g r_fish r_fish_g x_rule x_tea x_tea_n x_masha x_masha_n

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

A: So with is one small letter, с, and the word after it shows it: mostly ом, or ой for a word in а.
    highlight r_milk r_mum color #c9871a

    erase h_left h_right b_div r_sugar r_sugar_g r_cheese r_cheese_g r_milk r_milk_g r_bro r_bro_g r_mum r_mum_g r_sis r_sis_g r_fish r_fish_g x_rule x_tea x_tea_n x_masha x_masha_n

B: Ко́фе с молоко́м, пожа́луйста! Next time: my day, from morning to night. Пока́!
    icon e_coffee size 140 set twemoji x 420 y 560 or ["coffee"] icon_look picture of "hot beverage"
    icon e_milk size 140 set twemoji x 580 y 560 or ["milk"] icon_look picture of "glass of milk"
    text e_line "Ко́фе с молоко́м, пожа́луйста!" #3d3833 say "Ко́фе с молоко́м, пожа́луйста!" say_voice a x 500 y 390 font_size 62

